findings.what:
The hat lacquer is a uniform rough 0.71 with no painted sheen band, so it reads as painted paper rather than lacquer. The normal map carries almost no relief. The other materials, though, separate and read as themselves at the gameplay camera:
- the hat shows gores and a lit and a shaded side;
- the dark iron rim and the knob are distinct;
- the walnut pauldron and mask show painted grain;
- the cloth shows painted fold shading.
